                        "recommendationid": "38290453",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561197961078912",
                            "num_reviews": 4,
                            "playtime_forever": 1460,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 1210,
                            "last_played": 1512950478
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I'm not much for writing reviews regardless of how much I enjoy a game; however, it's a travesty that this game has no reviews at all. Besides the three playable characters, you get a monster tome that allows you multiple choices for your 4th character (creature in this case). I spent a lot of time grinding so that I could get and use all the choices, but I would say that I still got a good 20 hours with one playthrough.\n\nThere are a lot of secrets, multiple endings, custom animations, and a interesting and dark story. Games like these have become rather niche, but if you do enjoy these games this one is definitely a good choice.",
